{
  "schema": "openconductor.parity-checklist.v1",
  "scope": "Sidebar, Home and Create-workspace areas",
  "reference": "Conductor.app v0.87.6 REA Wave 0 evidence on main (evidence/frontend, evidence/sqlite, evidence/ipc, evidence/runtime, evidence/ledger)",
  "notes": [
    "Feature descriptions are our own words. Conductor UI strings are referenced by index into evidence/frontend/copy-catalog.json, never copied; the checker pins each index to a sha256 prefix so a regenerated catalog is detected.",
    "Detectors are case-insensitive regexes over our source (src/, src-tauri/src/, src-tauri/migrations/, migrations/). All match = implemented, some = partial, none = missing. They are a presence signal, not proof of behaviour; the report adjudicates by reading the code.",
    "No screenshots of Conductor exist (native UI capture blocked by TCC, see rea-test-report.md), so visual parity (layout, spacing, ordering) is not scored here."
  ],
  "items": [
    {
      "id": "sidebar.home-entry",
      "area": "sidebar",
      "feature": "Sidebar entry that returns to Home, plus a keyboard command to go Home",
      "evidence": {
        "copy": [
          2135,
          2050
        ],
        "routes": [
          "/"
        ]
      },
      "detect": [
        "HomeIcon|HomeButton|>Home<|kind:\\s*\"home\"",
        "go_?to_?home|goToHome|navigate\\w*\\(.{0,20}home"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "sidebar.top-bar",
      "area": "sidebar",
      "feature": "Sidebar top bar with a sidebar toggle button and back/forward history arrows",
      "evidence": {
        "files": [
          "evidence/screens/home--empty-signed-in--dark.png",
          "evidence/screens/home--empty-signed-in--light.png",
          "evidence/screens/manifest.json"
        ]
      },
      "detect": [
        "toggle_?(left_?)?sidebar|toggleSidebar",
        "go_?back|goBack|history\\.back|navigate\\(-1\\)",
        "go_?forward|goForward|history\\.forward"
      ]
    },
